# ci-inconclusive.txt

`agentcost report examples/cache_usage/traces.jsonl --compare openai anthropic --fail-if-worse --max-regression 5`

exit 0. Stdout contiene `**Verdict:** inconclusive`. Stderr:

```text
No shared task_id between 'openai' and 'anthropic'. Using the unpaired comparison.
Inconclusive: Fewer than 5 tasks in at least one variant (openai=1, anthropic=1). --max-regression needs a paired comparison. This report is unpaired, so there is no relative CI.
```

